Ketika, persistensi.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.150
Copilot berhenti saat obrolan ditutup.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.170
Tutup jendelanya, percakapan pun berakhir.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:42.690
Scout berjalan di latar belakang 2.

