00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.710
meskipun Scout belum diterapkan.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:51.710
Model identitas, struktur izin,

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:52.810
dan alur kerja persetujuan

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:53.590
yang Anda lancang sekarang

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:54.110
